{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "383e77c5407695e16717397b759f0c7a23a7a4b369f3b5c01af10ff12bd36bbc", "ja": "（『ソル』の天体公演ツアーが始まった。今日は\nゲリラライブの事後処理をしてきたところだ……）", "zh": "（《索尔》的天体公演巡演开始了。今天刚处理完那场突袭演出的后续事宜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "374d0e97d012a3c1c66b671750bdf30b37a0e873a4a427fdf7e193af277b914f", "ja": "{$P$}殿。\nこんな遅くまで、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "{$P$}殿。\n这么晚了，您辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b177de30cf59873707a9342d841e6f8667153c6370627d008607795754601a31", "ja": "あれ、律子。お疲れ様。\nもしかして今から帰りか？", "zh": "咦，律子。辛苦了。你现在是要回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "b72885cbf3d17691f176e8e50c83eaceb3beb2218bf036b59e88533d1f1ac006", "ja": "いえ、窓から姿が見えたので、\nここは一つ、お出迎えにと思いまして。", "zh": "没有，刚才从窗户看到了您的身影，\n就想着顺便来迎接您一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "47e706f81696d019a0e5561f3900034b8a0e108d313c67057face394d5009cb2", "ja": "この後、まだ作業ですよね？\n私も何か手伝いますよ。", "zh": "接下来还要继续工作吧？\n我也来帮忙做点什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1005_p", "source_sha256": "42d031982d1f23c5c9f08f5ea96bb274f2132f270528fa21a5053548b1202da6", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。あとは簡単な事務作業だけだし、\n律子には、今後のステージの準備に集中してほしいし。", "zh": "不用，没事的。剩下的只有简单的文书工作，\n而且我更希望律子能集中精力准备接下来的舞台演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "4b2040e086e55e9712999a2e08367958a4054e2660d3bb1aa591aeb21aa77d3a", "ja": "でも{$P$}、私たちの\nゲリラライブの後始末に行ってくれてたんですよね？", "zh": "可是，{$P$}，您还特意去处理我们那场快闪演出的善后了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "0bdb6e6f55fc9a568820d977487fee7625a68fe8d16f77ca51a0a2b487b32081", "ja": "ライブは最高でしたけど、ちょっとやりすぎたかな～\nって反省もしてたんです。だから……。", "zh": "演出虽然很棒，但我也在反省，是不是有点做过头了～所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3a875ba7cd370c2fd3c08a0efc4e9517da6276d1d85da62187bafa68e60bcdaf", "ja": "いやいや、こっちは準備を手伝えなかったんだから。\nせめて後始末くらいはしないとな。", "zh": "哪里哪里，我都没能帮上准备工作。\n至少善后工作得做好才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f1ba90dfc625a4a91bf7728720bd65312669c5e0d2501beaf99549364f4df507", "ja": "それに、ライブはやりすぎたって思うくらいがちょうど\nいいと思う。お客さんも楽しめたってことで。", "zh": "而且，我觉得演唱会做到让人觉得“是不是有点过头了”的程度，才算刚刚好。\n也算是让观众玩得尽兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "3efcbbaf37c4340633369b2015ede2ac7372949c52a4a4e6accce62ba081910c", "ja": "だといいんですけどね。私も、勢いに乗せられたと\nいうか、ブレーキが利かなくなったというか……。", "zh": "要是那样就好了。我也不知道该说是被气势带着走了，还是刹车失灵了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "e86c422c576c70905bca166dc438a9614b53c68763e5b925ee492ceaf3ee28eb", "ja": "まあ、結果として『ソル』の名前にふさわしい、\n熱いステージが見せられた、とは思ってますけど！", "zh": "不过，作为结果，我觉得我们确实展现出了配得上“索尔”之名的热烈舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7e81984106033a29fc4fb444d542b835219e6d5815db0d9ef8486fb287d97449", "ja": "ああ、天体公演の新章開幕として、\n最高のスタートが切れたと思う。", "zh": "啊，我觉得作为天体公演新篇章的开幕，这次开了个最棒的头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8174d22d2b9995f5e0fded43bdf8ce1fc4caab09a31fc8f0948a5fea5cb21f48", "ja": "ずっと律子たちを見てきた者としても、ゲリラライブは\n楽しませてもらったよ。だから、ここは任せてくれ。", "zh": "作为一直看着律子她们走到现在的人，这次快闪演出也让我很开心。所以，这里就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "7d738e0ff9d6600c268713a63a8838d81a57637fd0f7b3c6d279bc2d0e163fd8", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。\nそのお気持ちは嬉しいんですけど……。それはそれ。", "zh": "……谢谢您。\n能听到您这么说我很高兴……但这码归这码。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "cf0c02714f019d56499e7746d3bbc30c9e3f956946c6ae55aa6ae83cfe82606c", "ja": "私はアイドルですけど、事務所の仲間でもあるんです。\n仲間がおそーくまで残業してたら、手伝いますよね？", "zh": "我虽然是偶像，也是事务所的同伴嘛。要是同伴加班到很晚，我们当然会帮忙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "c71cacc77b16e64ebf1cca59e8116df5c0b655a870c716a37fe80132e1e659a7", "ja": "だから今回は、問答無用でお手伝いさせてもらいます！\nほら、二人で分担して、手早く終わらせますよ！", "zh": "所以这次，无论如何都请让我帮忙！来，我们两个人分工合作，赶紧把它做完！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf343e3137be1e9383141eb3e0238fb96fc360f267ecce84ec2b36b2ef238861", "ja": "……わかった、ありがとう。じゃあさっさと\n終わらせて、帰りに夜食でも食べにいくか！", "zh": "……好吧，谢谢你。那就赶紧\n搞定，回去的时候顺便去吃个夜宵吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "80b374e198b5283435fc45fb922a033c47bc90f06f2fe6efc09c82525adb1c9f", "ja": "おっ、いいですね。やる気が3割増しで出てきました！\nふふっ、何おごってもらおうかな～♪", "zh": "哦，这主意不错。干劲一下子增加了3成！\n嘿嘿，让我想想要让你请我吃什么好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a9ed8413f2109114c8d96a8593dedd983a12df2fe0febd3b9f691e2ec876ebb3", "ja": "うん？（おごる？）", "zh": "嗯？（你要请客？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0383_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "f1aae0f1380700ece9beb89747489aed04b88e187965c47b3fd5345b08fdce49", "ja": "うん？（なにか？）", "zh": "嗯？（怎么了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
